        "id": "p1",
        "kind": "MODULE",
        "module_id": "CP-2",
        "text": "Carvana has completed an operational and balance-sheet turnaround. For the twelve months ended June 30, 2026 the company generated $21,356M of net revenue and $2,294M of Adjusted EBITDA, with Q2 2026 reaching a record $769M (10.4% margin) on 197,325 retail units.",
