              "matched_text": "Retail units sold totaled 197,325, an increase of 38%; Revenue totaled $7.376 billion, an increase of 52%; Total Gross profit was $1.384 billion, an increase of 30%; Non-GAAP Total GPU was $7,125; Net income totaled $513 million; Adjusted EBITDA totaled $769 million.",
