      {
        "id": "p2",
        "kind": "MODULE",
        "module_id": "CP-1A",
        "text": "Total consolidated funded debt of $4,976M against unrestricted cash of $2,630M puts net funded leverage at 1.2x. Three tranches of Senior Secured Notes — $1,005M due 2028, $1,480M due 2030 and $1,444M due 2031 — sit above the Ally floor plan, renewed at $1.5 billion through April 30, 2027.",
