      {
        "id": "p6",
        "kind": "ANALYST_JUDGMENT",
        "module_id": null,
        "text": "What would change my view: the step from PIK-toggle to full cash interest on the 2028 notes is the test. A quarter in which non-GAAP total GPU holds above $5,500/unit through that step-up settles it in the issuer's favour; a floor-plan balance that ends a quarter well above the $58M drawn at Q2 settles it the other way.",
